    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/tax-tips/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Tax Tips </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Tax rates</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Reference</p>\n<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>Australian tax rates and thresholds</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> Resident, foreign resident and working holiday maker scales, plus the Medicare levy, study loan and offset thresholds — for the three years that are still lodgeable or current. </p>\n<p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft mt-2\"> Updated for 2024–25, 2025–26, 2026–27 · verified against <a href=\"https://www.ato.gov.au/tax-rates-and-codes/tax-rates-australian-residents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ato.gov.au</a> on 2026-08-21 · some 2026–27 thresholds are provisional pending ATO indexation </p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-8\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<div class=\"fy-switch\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> <input type=\"radio\" name=\"fy\" id=\"fy-2026-27\" class=\"sr-only\" checked data-astro-cid-fku4tryq><input type=\"radio\" name=\"fy\" id=\"fy-2025-26\" class=\"sr-only\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq><input type=\"radio\" name=\"fy\" id=\"fy-2024-25\" class=\"sr-only\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 rounded-[4px] border border-rule bg-white p-1\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\