d-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $158,001  and over </th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $316,002  and over </td>\n<td class=\"font-mono\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>1.5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> Only payable without private hospital cover. Family thresholds rise by  <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$1,500</span> for each child after the first. </p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-12 text-xl\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>Study and training loan repayments 2026–27</h2>\n<table class=\"mt-4\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<caption class=\"sr-only\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>Study loan repayment rates for 2026–27</caption>\n<thead data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<tr data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"col\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>Repayment income</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>Repayment</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<tr data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> Up to  – $69,528 </th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> Nil </td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $69,529  – $129,717 </th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> 15% of the amount over $69,528 </td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $129,718  – $186,050 </th>\n<td class=\"font-mono\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $9,028 plus 17% of the amount over $129,717 </td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-astro-cid-fku4tryq>\n<th scope=\"row\" class=\"font-mono text-[0.8125rem] font-normal normal-case tracking-normal\" data-astro-cid-fku4tryq> $186,051  